  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3108.05 Change of Ownership",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3108.05 Change of Ownership. In the event of a change of ownership or interest in the approved drivers’ school, an application for a new license shall be filed pursuant to Saf-C 3108.02.\n\nSource. #9568, eff 10-17-09 (from Saf-C 3110.03); ss by #12509, eff 4-5-18 (formerly Saf-C 3111.05) (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 3100)",
